      "raw": "<h3><strong>Stand with Ukraine!</strong></h3><p><strong><em>Any and all hardware and drone assembled from donations made to me in this project will be donated to Ukraine after they are built and tested.</em></strong><br>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"image image-style-align-center\"><img class=\"editor-image-resize\" src=\"https://media.printables.com/media/prints/1457783/rich_content/000b431e-011b-46d6-8779-7590901f4f62/image.png#%7B%22uuid%22%3A%2209374099-4b33-4e1a-b2fa-325ef20c07e6%22%2C%22w%22%3A960%2C%22h%22%3A640%7D\"></figure><p><strong><em>I would like to thank everyone that has donated. &nbsp;</em></strong><br><strong><em>Below is the number of drones that has been received by the Ukrainian forces.</em></strong></p><table><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p>Drone frames sent</p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><strong>82</strong></p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p>Drone FPV Kits sent</p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p>10</p></td></tr></table><h3>How to support?</h3><blockquote><p>If you would like to support the project and enable me to buy new components for new designs.<br>Please donate any amount here</p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://www.printables.com/model/1457783-quadbee-defend-your-country#join.@TomKnox.1573\"><strong>Join my club as a Peeky Blinder supporter</strong></a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/TomKnox3d?country.x=SE&amp;locale.x=en_US\"><strong>Donate through PayPal</strong></a></p></li></ul></blockquote><figure class=\"image image-style-align-center\"><img class=\"editor-image-resize\" src=\"https://media.printables.com/media/prints/1457783/rich_content/c178e49d-30a0-4702-9a48-fb4c65175ba1/image-1.png#%7B%22uuid%22%3A%22adcc0f5a-1e02-4177-98a8-7c8872579452%22%2C%22w%22%3A697%2C%22h%22%3A565%7D\"></figure><h3>Introduction</h3><p>After the Ukrainian army successfully has used and deployed thousands of drones.&nbsp;<br>I want to enable regular people to learn and prepare themselves.<br>Homemade drones are very effective, and using 3d-printers has been absolutely crucial for the Ukrainian army.<br>Both out in the field, but also for educational use.&nbsp;<br><br><br>My goal is to enable regular people to build their own drones.&nbsp;<br>Either for fun, for the FPV experience or to prepare and further build another tool that can be used.&nbsp;<br>Either defensively but also for reconnaissance</p><h3><strong>Print guideline</strong></h3><p>Here are print guidelines for you to follow in order to have decent success with printing parts:</p><table style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: var(--table-text-always-dark);\"><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: var(--table-text-always-dark); vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p><strong>Infill type</strong></p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p>Gyroid, Honeycomb, Triangle or Cubic</p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: var(--table-text-always-dark); vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p><strong>Material</strong></p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p>PCCF, PACF, ASA, ABS, PCTG, PETG, (TPU for Antenna Brackets)</p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: var(--table-text-always-dark); vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p><strong>Infill percentage</strong></p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p>35%&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: var(--table-text-always-dark); vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p><strong>Layer height</strong></p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p>0.2mm, recommended</p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: var(--table-text-always-dark); vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p><strong>Wall count</strong></p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p>Recommended: 4</p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: var(--table-text-always-dark); vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p><strong>Solid top/bottom layers</strong></p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p>Recommended: 5</p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: var(--table-text-always-dark); vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p><strong>Extrusion width</strong></p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(179, 179, 179); border-width: 0.533333px;\"><p>0.4mm, recommended</p></td></tr></table><h3>Tools</h3><p>Needed or good to have tools for this project.</p><table><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><strong>Soldering Iron TS101</strong></p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://s.click.aliexpress.com/e/_c2QmV6QP\">Aliexpress Link</a></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://geni.us/rPNNHLD\">Amazon Link</a></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><em>(Recommended)</em></p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><strong>Heat Inset Tip Kit - For TS101</strong></p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://s.click.aliexpress.com/e/_c4oAQMU5\">Aliexpress Link</a></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://geni.us/hrT4m82\">Amazon Link</a></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><em>(Recommended)</em></p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><strong>Electric Precision Screwdriver&nbsp;</strong></p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://s.click.aliexpress.com/e/_c4WbOjBf\">Aliexpress Link</a></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">