><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://s.click.aliexpress.com/e/_c3lakGcl\">Aliexpress Link</a></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://geni.us/pBQCzkI\">Amazon Link</a></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p>Filament - TPU</p></th><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://s.click.aliexpress.com/e/_c4mEXgLb\">Aliexpress Link</a></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"editor-link\" href=\"https://geni.us/NGlAPc\">Amazon Link</a></p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr></table><h3><br>&nbsp;<br><br>Goals:</h3><p>I have set out a couple of goals.<br>Any designs that I make in this project will be uploaded as variants and open to anyone to use.<br>But I lack the electronics and hardware and rely heavily on donations to test it.<br>There's just so far you can come in CAD alone.<br>For obvious reasons I can't share the CAD-files that is used today in field.&nbsp;<br>There's a need to make new designs.<br><br>I would like to do the following in the short/medium term future:</p><ul><li><p>Develop and share a new payload system. &nbsp;<strong><em>(There are complete payload units listed in the BOM)</em></strong></p></li><li><p>Develop and build variants that can handle different types of payload</p></li><li><p>Develop and build a variant that can be used to transport medical supplies including medicine that</p></li><li><p>needs to be kept refrigerated</p></li><li><p>Develop and build variants for other purposes - Mine detection etc</p></li><li><p>Streamline the enclosures to give it at least IP2x</p></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p></p>",
